    description: Some("A babysitter searches the sixteen rooms of a two-storey house for terrified children, locking each one onto her and racing it to one of the four safe rooms while the killer roams. A single knife hidden somewhere in the house is her only defence, useless while she is carrying a child, and blackouts on the faulty upper floor can leave her in the dark with him still coming."),
